                                "sense_id": "3818e14d-e381-3b39-b0ac-f8c8000ebe5a",
                                "text": "For every branch of jurisprudence secular or sacred and therefore also for canonical and creedal jurisprudence, this implies at least the following five issues: enactment, ratification, enforcement, compliance, interpretation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7e20e8a-02b1-4912-a131-0c6df1b1c11a",
                                "sense_id": "3818e14d-e381-3b39-b0ac-f8c8000ebe5a",
                                "text": "These creedal principles deeply shaped American politics during the heyday of the neoliberal order."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d52e024-bf69-4507-a0cd-1b618d482a83",
                                "sense_id": "3818e14d-e381-3b39-b0ac-f8c8000ebe5a",
                                "text": "[…] This liberal idea that the nation is a commitment to a set of fairly abstract values—that you can’t really build a nation on that. That what gets called creedal nationalism—this nationalism of a shared story—that's not, for you, a real nation. That it won't hold together."
                            }
